<view class="screen"><view class="eyebrow">OUR LITTLE EXPLORERS</view><view class="title">谁来听故事？</view><view class="subtitle">一个微信账号，一家人的小小冒险。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在寻找伙伴…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button wx:if="{{!busy}}" bindtap="retry" class="small">刷新角色</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loading}}"><button wx:for="{{players}}" wx:key="id" class="player-card {{player.id === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select"><view class="row"><view><text class="badge">{{avatars[item.avatar]}}</text> {{item.name}}</view><text>{{player.id === item.id ? '✓ 当前角色' : '选择'}}</text></view><view class="muted">⭐ {{item.stars}} 星光 · 走到第 {{item.lastLesson}} 课</view></button>
    <view class="card"><view class="section-title">认识新伙伴</view><input class="field" placeholder="给小伙伴起个名字" maxlength="16" value="{{name}}" bindinput="nameChanged"/><view class="avatar-grid"><button wx:for="{{avatarOptions}}" wx:key="id" class="avatar {{avatar === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="avatarChanged"><view class="badge">{{item.icon}}</view><view>{{item.name}}</view></button></view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="create">{{busy ? '正在认识新朋友…' : '创建角色'}}</button><view class="note">昵称只用于当前账号内的角色。切换角色后，进度与奖杯分别保存。</view></view><button bindtap="map">带小伙伴去冒险 →</button>
  </view>
</view>
